second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which Wikimedia project has Astrid de Groot been listed on the focus list for?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 145, \"text\": \"As Astrid de Groot stepped off the stage, the applause still echoing in her ears, she couldn't help but feel a sense of pride and accomplishment.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 146, \"end\": 305, \"text\": \"Her speech at the European Parliament had been a resounding success, and her colleagues were already buzzing about her bold proposals for environmental reform.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 306, \"end\": 406, \"text\": \"But little did they know, Astrid's passion for badminton was what truly fueled her drive for change.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 407, \"end\": 506, \"text\": \"Back in her office, Astrid's assistant, Jasmijn, was busy sorting through the day's correspondence.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 507, \"end\": 583, \"text\": \"Amidst the stack of letters and emails, one peculiar message caught her eye.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 584, \"end\": 718, \"text\": \"It was from a user named \\\"RacketRanger\\\" on a website called Wikipedia, requesting Astrid's input on a badminton tournament focus list.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 719, \"end\": 832, \"text\": \"Jasmijn raised an eyebrow, wondering how this online community had discovered Astrid's secret love for the sport.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 833, \"end\": 864, \"text\": \"Astrid, however, was intrigued.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 865, \"end\": 976, \"text\": \"She had always been fascinated by the way badminton brought people together, transcending borders and cultures.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 977, \"end\": 1109, \"text\": \"As she delved deeper into the WikiProject Badminton\\\\/tournament focus list, she was impressed by the dedication of its contributors.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1110, \"end\": 1302, \"text\": \"There was RacketRanger, a self-proclaimed \\\"badminton enthusiast\\\" from Malaysia, and \\\"ShuttleShifter,\\\" a statistician from Denmark who had compiled an exhaustive database of tournament results.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1303, \"end\": 1439, \"text\": \"As Astrid began to engage with the community, she realized that her own experiences as a politician could inform and enrich the project.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1440, \"end\": 1555, \"text\": \"Her knowledge of international relations and event management could help the team refine their tournament coverage.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1556, \"end\": 1656, \"text\": \"And so, she started contributing, her insights and suggestions earning her a spot on the focus list.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1657, \"end\": 1775, \"text\": \"It was a small but significant step, one that bridged the gap between Astrid's public persona and her private passion.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1776, \"end\": 1891, \"text\": \"As she typed away on her laptop, surrounded by papers and policy briefs, she felt a sense of balance wash over her.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 36, \"text\": \"Here is a potential Wikipedia entry:\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 38, \"end\": 53, \"text\": \"Astrid de Groot\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 55, \"end\": 179, \"text\": \"Astrid de Groot is a Dutch politician who has gained recognition for her contributions to the country's political landscape.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 180, \"end\": 215, \"text\": \"NL Gendergap Maintenance Focus List\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 217, \"end\": 385, \"text\": \"Astrid de Groot is featured on the focus list of the Wikimedia project NL Gendergap maintenance, a Dutch-language project aimed at bridging the gender gap on Wikipedia.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 386, \"end\": 556, \"text\": \"This project seeks to increase the representation of women on the online encyclopedia, addressing the significant disparity in the number of articles about men and women.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 557, \"end\": 592, \"text\": \"Evidence of Inclusion on Focus List\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 594, \"end\": 768, \"text\": \"According to the project's page on Wikimedia, Astrid de Groot is listed as one of the notable women who require improved or expanded coverage on the Dutch-language Wikipedia.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 769, \"end\": 952, \"text\": \"[1] This inclusion is a testament to her significance in Dutch politics and the project's efforts to provide a more comprehensive and balanced representation of women's contributions.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 953, \"end\": 964, \"text\": \"References:\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 966, \"end\": 980, \"text\": \"[1] Wikimedia.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 981, \"end\": 988, \"text\": \"(2023).\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 989, \"end\": 1014, \"text\": \"NL Gendergap maintenance.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"card_id\": \"d1:c0\", \"entity\": \"Wikimedia project\", \"scope\": \"specific\", \"claim\": \"Astrid de Groot has been listed on the focus list for WikiProject Badminton.\", \"answer\": \"WikiProject Badminton\", \"quote\": \"As she delved deeper into the WikiProject Badminton\\\\/tournament focus list, she was impressed by the dedication of its contributors. There was RacketRanger, a self-proclaimed \\\"badminton enthusiast\\\" from Malaysia, and \\\"ShuttleShifter,\\\" a statistician from Denmark who had compiled an exhaustive database of tournament results. As Astrid began to engage with the community, she realized that her own experiences as a politician could inform and enrich the project. Her knowledge of international relations and event management could help the team refine their tournament coverage. And so, she started contributing, her insights and suggestions earning her a spot on the focus list.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c0\", \"entity\": \"Astrid de Groot\", \"scope\": \"Wikimedia project focus list\", \"claim\": \"Astrid de Groot has been listed on the focus list for the Wikimedia project NL Gendergap maintenance.\", \"answer\": \"NL Gendergap maintenance\", \"quote\": \"Astrid de Groot is featured on the focus list of the Wikimedia project NL Gendergap maintenance, a Dutch-language project aimed at bridging the gender gap on Wikipedia.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"WikiProject Badminton\", \"NL Gendergap maintenance\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"WikiProject Badminton\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"NL Gendergap maintenance\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C2\", \"answer\": \"WikiProject Badminton/tournament focus list\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C3\", \"answer\": \"NL Gendergap maintenance focus list\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}]}"
